sentences.text:
The essential  ingredients of the offence of "cheating" are as follows:
 (i) deception of a person either by making a false or  misleading representation or by dishonest  concealment or by any other act or omission;
 (ii) fraudulent or dishonest inducement of that  person to either deliver any property or to  consent to the retention thereof by any person or  to intentionally induce that person so deceived
